---
name: sigil-review
description: Collect two agent reviews of a request or revision.
engine: 0.2.0-lab.1
roles: [lead, a, b]
---
"""
Review a request or a revision. Two reviewers report independently, and the run
collects both reports. Collected means both reports arrived, not that either
report approved the work.
"""
contract @1h => expired

"""
Send one labelled request or revision to both reviewers. Read both reports
before deciding anything; a single approval is not consensus.
"""
role lead

"""
Review the labelled request or revision independently. Name the label you are
answering and give approve, revise or reject with your reasons.
"""
role a

"""
Review the labelled request or revision independently. Name the label you are
answering and give approve, revise or reject with your reasons.
"""
role b

"""
A first-round request, identified by an uppercase label.
"""
type request
  label: text(1..32, regex: ~r/[A-Z][A-Z0-9_-]*/)

"""
A revised version of earlier work, identified by an uppercase label.
"""
type revision
  label: text(1..32, regex: ~r/[A-Z][A-Z0-9_-]*/)

"""
One reviewer's decision on the request or revision it names.
"""
type review
  source: ref(~w[request revision])
  decision: enum(~w[approve revise reject])

"""
The lead sends a request or a revision to both reviewers.
"""
state new
  lead -> ~w[a b]: request() as task => reviewing
  lead -> ~w[a b]: revision() as task => reviewing

"""
Both reviewers report within five minutes.
"""
state reviewing
  ~w[a b] -> lead: review(source=$task) each @5m => collected | stalled

"""
Both reports arrived. The lead weighs them; disagreement stays visible.
"""
end collected

"""
A report is missing. The lead decides whether to proceed on partial review.
"""
end stalled
